    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Georges Quay Apartment, an exceptionally well-presented one-bedroom one home office residence, ideally situated along the banks of the River Liffey in the very centre of Dublin City.\r\nPositioned just a short stroll from O’Connell Bridge, this apartment is maintained in immaculate condition throughout. The layout includes a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright open-plan living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, one spacious double bedrooms, and a main bathroom.\r\nGeorges Quay Apartments is a contemporary, high-quality development offering residents unparalleled convenience, with every conceivable city centre amenity within easy reach. Iconic locations such as O’Connell Street, Grafton Street, Trinity College, the Docklands, and the IFSC are all nearby. The area is exceptionally well connected, with excellent public transport links and a frequent bus service right on the doorstep. Residents also benefit from a wide range of local amenities, including boutique shops, cafés, and popular dining options."
      }
    ],
